WEBVTT

00:00:00.035 --> 00:00:02.844
At the end, report the outcome and links, revision,

00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:07.070
completed and pending work, tests and evidence, actual

00:00:07.163 --> 00:00:11.784
model routes and exposed usage, assumptions, blockers,

00:00:12.167 --> 00:00:16.045
uncertain external effects, rollback, and the next safe

00:00:16.091 --> 00:00:16.591
action.

00:00:17.288 --> 00:00:19.842
Label offline and live evidence correctly.

00:00:20.225 --> 00:00:22.768
Include the first few things the owner should inspect.

00:00:23.209 --> 00:00:26.111
If a deadline or blocker ends the run early, say so

00:00:26.169 --> 00:00:26.703
plainly.

00:00:27.087 --> 00:00:30.628
Completion is a proven state, not a confident sentence.
